<p:sld xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{CEE645ED-9EF7-DFCC-C8BC-8E35914170EE}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="4" name="Title 3"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{0FAE0C5C-DB18-8C16-D683-D13FF2BF4C06}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="title"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>SIGA-REL INSTALLATION NOTES</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="5" name="Content Placeholder 4"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{2A662909-617A-9812-0DAF-8B712038C056}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph sz="half" idx="1"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="1447330" y="2010878"/><a:ext cx="9605635" cy="4500091"/></a:xfrm></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr><a:normAutofit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Install the SIGA-REL only in an enclosure dedicated to the releasing device service. See “Specifications” on page 5 for a list of compatible enclosures. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Maintain a minimum clearance of 1 in. (25.4 mm) all around the SIGA-REL. The clearance space must also comply with NFPA 70 National Electrical Code, or with C22.1 Canadian Electrical Code, Part I. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Installations that include other wiring require FPL, FPLR, FPLP, or equivalent NEC-approved wiring for all power-limited wiring. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>The SIGA-REL ships with 47 </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>kΩ</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t> test resistors to prevent unused circuits from activating trouble events. When connecting the field wiring, remove the test resistors and terminate the circuits with UL/ULC Listed EOLRs. </a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree><p:extLst><p:ext uri="{BB962C8B-B14F-4D97-AF65-F5344CB8AC3E}"><p14:creationId xmlns:p14="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/powerpoint/2010/main" val="385775973"/></p:ext></p:extLst></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>